	Lorem ipsum|-dolor--
	sit amet consectetur.
:type 100b
	|Lorem ipsum-dolor--
	sit amet consectetur.
:type b
	|Lorem ipsum-dolor--
	sit amet consectetur.
:end

:start Motion B (back WORD)
