	Lorem |ipsum-dolor--
	  s!,1.425it amet consectetur
:type 100B
	|Lorem ipsum-dolor--
	  s!,1.425it amet consectetur
:type B
	|Lorem ipsum-dolor--
	  s!,1.425it amet consectetur
